<view class="page">
  <view class="section-head">
    <text class="eyebrow">第一步</text>
    <text class="title">今天喝哪家？</text>
    <text class="subtitle">品牌名仅用于选择路径，结果是趣味估算。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="brand-grid">
    <button
      wx:for="{{brands}}"
      wx:key="id"
      class="brand-card"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
      bindtap="openBrand"
    >
      <view class="brand-copy">
        <image class="brand-logo" src="{{item.logo}}" mode="aspectFit"></image>
        <text class="brand-name">{{item.name}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="brand-hint">{{item.drinkCount}} 款</text>
    </button>
  </view>

  <view class="soft-note">
    <image src="/assets/icons/pearls.png" mode="aspectFit"></image>
    <text>热量为估算值，非品牌官方数据，仅供趣味参考。</text>
  </view>
</view>
